        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-2222, Beaded Cabinet Knob with Tip</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Beaded Cabinet Knob features a classic design that has been a long-time favorite. The beading along the edge brings a point of interest to this cabinet hardware--adding a little bit of old world beauty. It has a 1-1/4 inch diameter and is available in 6 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-2222 Beaded Edge Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
